# The KOF collection may contain series KOF does not license for
# redistribution, and this repository is public. Keep the downloaded data out
# of git until it is confirmed which series may be published; then remove the
# lines for the files that may (see kof/README.md and the issue).
kof_series.csv
kof_metadata.csv
kof_release.csv

# An R session started in this folder (as the first real run was) writes its
# command history here, and a session that set up KOF credentials would carry
# them in it. Never publish it.
.Rhistory
.RData
